Derivative work notes:

  - The frontend (React 19 + Vite multi-entry UI) was rewritten from scratch;
    the original Next.js frontend code is not included.
  - The Rust scheduler / SQLite storage / window management were redesigned
    around multi-task timing, quiet hours and reminder profiles. The approach
    for the tray icon, multi-monitor fullscreen windows and idle/lock detection
    takes inspiration from Shui's implementation.
  - Bitmap icons under src-tauri/icons/ were regenerated from SVG sources
    (src-tauri/icon-source.svg, src-tauri/tray-source.svg).
